guide forever/class/druid/aquatic-form
title Aquatic Form
category Class
folder Druid
keywords Aquatic Form, A Lesson to Learn, Trial of the Lake, Trial of the Sea Lion, Pendant of the Sea Lion, Strange Lockbox, Shrine of Remulos, Idol of Shifting Tides, Moonglade, class quest
reward spell 1066 "Aquatic Form"
reward item 263411
reward item 16608
why Your water travel form: swim fast and breathe underwater, with a belt and an idol besides.
class Druid
levels 16-22
zone Moonglade

# Aquatic Form: in Forever Aquatic Form (5061 Night Elf, 31 Tauren) rewards
# the form itself and the Idol of Shifting Tides besides the Aquarius Belt
# (Wowhead Forever's druid class page: "Rewards: adds Aquatic Form, Idol of
# Shifting Tides").
# Chain: A Lesson to Learn (26 / 27, your trainer) -> Trial of the Lake (29 /
# 28: a Shrine Bauble from Lake Elune'ara used at the Shrine of Remulos) ->
# Trial of the Sea Lion (272 / 30: the two half pendants from Strange
# Lockboxes, joined near the shrine) -> Aquatic Form back at your trainer.
# Night Elves find the halves in Darkshore and Westfall, Tauren in the Barrens
# and Silverpine Forest.
# The leveling guides carry the chain inline (Night Elves in
# alliance/03-darkshore, 04-redridge-mountains and 06-ashenvale; Tauren in
# horde/03-silverpine-forest and 04-the-barrens): this guide is for druids off
# our route. Skyborne: Wowhead Forever opens the Alliance chain (26, 29, 272,
# 5061) to Skyborne druids too (corrections.json, checked 2026-10-16); this
# guide has no Skyborne steps yet.
# Sources: quests.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0,
# Forever); the lockbox tips are the ones the leveling guides above use.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Night Elves

step A Lesson to Learn
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands in the Cenarion Enclave.
  level 16
  accept 26                             -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Trial of the Lake
  only NightElf
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Shrine Baubles lie in the containers on the floor of Lake Elune'ara, below Nighthaven: take one to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it there and speak to Tajarri.
  turnin 26                             -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 29
  collect 15877 x1                      -- Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake
  use 15877 @36.0,41.4                  -- At the Shrine of Remulos
  complete 29
  turnin 29                             -- Tajarri
  accept 272

step Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility
  only NightElf
  zone Darkshore
  tip Fly from Nighthaven to Auberdine. The Strange Lockbox lies under the water off the north coast, west of the Ruins of Mathystra.
  fly "Auberdine"
  collect 15883 x1                      -- Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility

step Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance
  only NightElf
  zone Westfall
  tip Take the boat from Auberdine to Stormwind and fly to Sentinel Hill. Ride north-west to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies on the sea floor off the shore.
  fly "Sentinel Hill"
  collect 15882 x1                      -- Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance

step Pendant of the Sea Lion
  only NightElf
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Join the two halves into the Pendant of the Sea Lion near the Shrine of Remulos, on the north-west shore of the lake, then see Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Fly to Rut'theran Village afterwards.
  collect 15885 quest 272.1             -- Pendant of the Sea Lion: join the halves at the shrine
  turnin 272                            -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 5061
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Aquatic Form
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up to Mathrengyl in the Cenarion Enclave.
  turnin 5061 reward 16608 263411       -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Aquatic Form

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tauren

step A Lesson to Learn
  only Tauren
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Turak Runetotem stands on Elder Rise.
  level 16
  accept 27                             -- Turak Runetotem

step Trial of the Lake
  only Tauren
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. The Shrine Baubles lie on the bed of Lake Elune'ara and fade within minutes: swim one straight to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it there and speak to Tajarri.
  turnin 27                             -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 28
  collect 15877 x1                      -- Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake
  use 15877 @36.0,41.4                  -- At the Shrine of Remulos
  complete 28
  turnin 28                             -- Tajarri
  accept 30

step Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance
  only Tauren
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff, fly to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades; Silverpine Forest is south of the Undercity. The Strange Lockbox lies on the coast west of the Dead Field, north of the Sepulcher.
  collect 15882 x1                      -- Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance

step Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility
  only Tauren
  zone The Barrens
  tip The Strange Lockbox lies at the north edge of the Sludge Fen, by the Venture Co. tower, north of the Crossroads.
  collect 15883 x1                      -- Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility

step Pendant of the Sea Lion
  only Tauren
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Join the two halves into the Pendant of the Sea Lion near the Shrine of Remulos, on the north-west shore of the lake, then see Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Bunthen Plainswind flies druids to Thunder Bluff.
  collect 15885 quest 30.1              -- Pendant of the Sea Lion: join the halves at the shrine
  turnin 30                             -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 31
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step Aquatic Form
  only Tauren
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 31 reward 16608 263411         -- Turak Runetotem: Aquatic Form
